-( Converting .e² to Native Executables )
-{
    The ricer.e² tool converts .e² files to native OS executables:
    
    Windows (.exe):
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program.exe
    -(Generates MZ/PE format executable)
    
    Linux (ELF):
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program
    -(Generates ELF format executable)
    
    macOS (Mach-O):
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program
    -(Generates Mach-O format executable)
    
    The riced executable:
    - Embeds the mc² runtime
    - Is standalone (no mc² installation required)
    - Runs directly: ./program or program.exe
    - Preserves all program semantics
    
    Cross-compilation:
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program.exe -target windows
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program -target linux
    :: ricer.e² program.e² -o program -target macos
}


